Methods
-------
The GKS-EDA and GKS-EDA(sol) methods were developed by Peifeng Su and
co-workers. EDA_GPU is an independent implementation written from the
published papers; it does not contain code from XEDA, GAMESS or any other
program. Use of the method should cite the original publications, listed in
src/eda_gpu/citations.py and in README.md.

Third-party data included for validation and comparison
-------------------------------------------------------
The following files contain values transcribed from published sources. They
remain subject to the terms of their original sources and are NOT covered by
this repository's licenses:
- examples/hplc/sturm2007_tableS1.csv
    Sturm, Quinten, Huber, Kohlbacher, Nucleic Acids Res. 35 (2007) 4195,
    doi:10.1093/nar/gkm338, Supplementary Table S1.
- references/xeda_ii_co2_b3lyp.json and examples/co2_dimer_xeda_ii.*
